        "slc_4e9a49e74f38e566d9f998a6c28f1aecdee426211bcc30db43840803f223e016"
      ],
      "text": "The notes are structured into learning paths, including Azure AI Services, computer vision with Azure AI Vision, NLP with Azure AI Services, and knowledge mining with Azure AI Search."
